<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-yuanzhan" book-id="b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts" chapter-id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts" source-id="s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794">
  <p id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">魏故使持節假黃鉞侍中太傅大司馬尚書令定州刺史<persName id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p001:m0022" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">廣陽文獻王</persName>銘。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">公諱<persName id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002:m0002" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">湛</persName>，字<persName id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002:m0005" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">士深</persName>，河南洛陽人也。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">春秋卅有五，以武定二年歲在甲子五月十四日丁酉薨於鄴。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p004" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">王如故，謚曰文獻，禮也。粵以其年八月庚申葬於武城之北原。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p005" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">芒阜臨北，魚山望東，安厝不異，託葬攸同。</p>
</text>
